                        "sense_id": "3fc0122b-f131-38e2-8f9e-ed756d73316b",
                        "entry_id": "9f1b4bdc-5587-315f-b81b-33ee6dc0bbe2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a lusty manner: vigorously, loudly, enthusiastically."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "07b202b8-2076-4ab3-9fe2-c8694e996cb6",
                                "sense_id": "3fc0122b-f131-38e2-8f9e-ed756d73316b",
                                "text": "[…] I walked lustily in the park by moonshine till eight, to shake off my dinner and wine; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d669fe58-fb8b-40f9-8348-82dd11028384",
                                "sense_id": "3fc0122b-f131-38e2-8f9e-ed756d73316b",
                                "text": "As I entered the room, the fire from the large square stove, where the logs were burning lustily, threw a red, flickering light through the wide-open door over the room[.]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0692525-b278-41a3-94c5-21f6e47ef8c1",
                                "sense_id": "3fc0122b-f131-38e2-8f9e-ed756d73316b",
                                "text": "Then, while some of the others gathered around the girl played \"Waiting for the Wagon,\" \"Aunt Dinah's Quilting Party,\" and a number of other favorites, and these the crowd sang lustily."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a089bbc7-98c6-4fb9-8fc0-4399197ba3cd",
                                "sense_id": "3fc0122b-f131-38e2-8f9e-ed756d73316b",
                                "text": "Momma, Monique, and Paula retreat to a corner of the kitchen while the main party, including old Johnny who has winked lustily at Momma's backside all night long, stays behind in the living room…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
